name: Exact matrix reports preserve raw observations, human decisions and shared spending
size: 120x36
cwd: @TMP_TARGET
env-unset: ANTHROPIC_API_KEY OPENAI_API_KEY NODE_OPTIONS NO_COLOR KUZUSHI_MODEL KUZUSHI_LANGGRAPH_BRIDGE
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/matrix_report.py @TMP_TARGET @ART seed @TMP_HOME
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | ready
paste-file: @ART/study-command.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 9 completed | archived-jobs
nav-mode:
keys: a
require-live-snap: 25 APPROVED STUDY | saved-study
keys: Down Down Down Down Down Down Down Down Down Enter v
require-live-snap: 25 observed 3 / 3 | case-results
keys: R
require-live-snap: 25 Context cases: 3 | matrix-report
expect: 6 raw observations
expect: observed 3 / 3
expect: observed 2 / 3
expect: observed 1 / 3
ask: Does this report name the selected matrix, separate case recurrence, source limitations and shared allowance without claiming all findings true or source fixes?
keys: p
keys: End
live-snap: exact-report-details
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/matrix_report.py @TMP_TARGET @ART read
keys: Escape
require-live-snap: 20 CONTEXT CASES | exact-report-origin
keys: Escape Escape Escape
submit: open F-0001
require-live-snap: 25 Labeled synthetic matrix observation | finding
submit: dismiss false_positive J110 labeled false positive
require-live-snap: 25 J110 labeled false positive | human-decision
ask: Is the human false-positive decision recorded with its reason while the six raw observations remain available?
paste-file: @ART/study-command.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 9 completed | reviewed-study
nav-mode:
keys: a
require-live-snap: 25 APPROVED STUDY | reviewed-plan
keys: Down Down Down Down Down Down Down Down Down Enter v R
require-live-snap: 25 1 reviewed | reviewed-matrix-report
keys: Down Down Down
keys: Home
live-snap: json-report
expect: json · all ·
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 EXPORTED | exported-json
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/matrix_report.py @TMP_TARGET @ART exported
ask: Does the export receipt show the actual outcome and a scoped JSON report retaining the human decision, six observations, separate recurrence and unknown dollar consumption?
keys: p
resize: 160x48
keys: Home
live-snap: report-160x48
resize: 96x89
keys: Home
live-snap: report-96x89
resize: 80x24
keys: Home
live-snap: report-80x24
resize: 60x20
keys: Home
live-snap: report-60x20
resize: 40x12
keys: Home
live-snap: report-40x12
keys: PgDn PgDn
live-snap: report-middle-40x12
keys: End
live-snap: report-tail-40x12
expect: json · all ·
ask: Can keyboard-only operators read cases, source references, spending and export controls at every supported size without changing scope or starting work?
resize: 120x36
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME NO_COLOR=1 KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | restarted
paste-file: @ART/study-command.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 9 completed | restarted-study
nav-mode:
keys: a
require-live-snap: 25 APPROVED STUDY | restarted-plan
keys: Down Down Down Down Down Down Down Down Down Enter v R
require-live-snap: 25 1 reviewed | recovered-report
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/matrix_report.py @TMP_TARGET @ART restarted
ask: Does no-color restart recover the same scoped report and recorded decision with no new model request, source change or allowance revision?
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
